  "summary": "The code is well-structured and demonstrates core Service Bus messaging patterns (single send, batch send, receive, subscribe, topic/subscription). It uses the latest @azure/service-bus package and has clean async/await patterns with proper resource cleanup. Key gaps: uses connection string auth instead of @azure/identity, lacks RestError handling, omits @azure/logger diagnostic logging, and doesn't demonstrate abandonMessage() or deadLetterMessage() as required by the prompt.",
  "issues": [
